{"seq":5,"slug":"design-and-advanced","title":"第五章 动效设计与高级技术","docCount":4,"url":"/h/frontend/web-animation/design-and-advanced","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"meaningful-and-natural","title":"有意义的动效与模拟自然","url":"/h/frontend/web-animation/design-and-advanced/meaningful-and-natural","wordCount":1416,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"orchestration-and-accessibility","title":"编排、连续性与无障碍","url":"/h/frontend/web-animation/design-and-advanced/orchestration-and-accessibility","wordCount":1835,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"scroll-svg-canvas","title":"滚动驱动动画与 SVG/Canvas","url":"/h/frontend/web-animation/design-and-advanced/scroll-svg-canvas","wordCount":1452,"readingTime":6},{"seq":4,"slug":"transitions-physics-significance","title":"共享元素过渡、物理动画与意义","url":"/h/frontend/web-animation/design-and-advanced/transitions-physics-significance","wordCount":2042,"readingTime":9}],"introMarkdown":"# 第五章 动效设计与高级技术\n\n掌握了实现技术与性能原理之后，本章上升到设计层面、并拓展到高级领域。先探讨动效设计的核心原则——什么样的动画才是\"好\"的动画：有意义、模拟自然、精心编排、包容无障碍；再概览 Web 动画更广阔的天地——滚动驱动动画、SVG 与 Canvas 图形动画、共享元素过渡、基于物理的交互。\n\n本章分四节：有意义与模拟自然；编排连续性与无障碍；滚动驱动与 SVG/Canvas；共享元素过渡、物理动画与 Web 动画的整体意义。读完本章，你将懂得\"如何做对动画\",并领略动画前沿的表现力，为全书作结。\n"}